Pseudo-code:
```tsx
const ProtestForm = () => {
  const [routePoints, setRoutePoints] = useState<[number, number][]>([])
  const [formData, setFormData] = useState({ title_en: '', cause_en: '', ... })
  const [drawMode, setDrawMode] = useState(false)

  const handleMapClick = (lngLat: [number, number]) => {
    if (drawMode) setRoutePoints([...routePoints, lngLat])
  }

  const handleSubmit = async () => {
    const route = {
      type: 'LineString',
      coordinates: routePoints
    }
    await api.createProtest({ ...formData, route })
  }

  return (
    <form>
      <input name="title_en" onChange={...} />
      <Map onClick={handleMapClick} routePreview={routePoints} />
      <button onClick={handleSubmit}>Create Protest</button>
    </form>
  )
}
```

Implement parking/chips features in `frontend/src/components/ParkingPanel.tsx`:
1. Device token bootstrap: on first load, check localStorage for `deviceToken`. If missing, call `POST /api/devices`, store token in localStorage (never sent to server except as auth header)
2. "Use My Location" button: fetch user's geolocation, call `GET /api/parking?lat=&lng=&radius=800` and `GET /api/chips?lat=&lng=&radius=800`, display nearby parking/chips as list and map markers
3. Drop chip: button that sends current geolocation to `POST /api/chips` with `x-device-token` header, refresh chips list on success
4. Mark chip taken: button on each chip (only for chips dropped by other devices), calls `POST /api/chips/:id/taken`, removes from map
5. Delete own chip: button on chips dropped by this device, calls `DELETE /api/chips/:id`
6. Auto-refresh chips every 30s (setInterval polling) to show new/removed chips
7. Display legal parking (DB + OSM) and chips with different marker styles on map

Handle rate limit errors (429) gracefully with user message. Show chip TTL countdown. Bilingual UI.

Pseudo-code:
```tsx
const ParkingPanel = () => {
  const [deviceToken, setDeviceToken] = useState<string>()
  const [location, setLocation] = useState<[number, number]>()
  const [parking, setParking] = useState<ParkingSpot[]>([])
  const [chips, setChips] = useState<Chip[]>([])

  useEffect(() => {
    const token = localStorage.getItem('deviceToken')
    if (!token) {
      api.createDevice().then(t => {
        localStorage.setItem('deviceToken', t)
        setDeviceToken(t)
      })
    } else setDeviceToken(token)
  }, [])

  const handleUseMyLocation = () => {
    navigator.geolocation.getCurrentPosition(pos => {
      const loc = [pos.coords.longitude, pos.coords.latitude]
      setLocation(loc)
      api.getParking(loc[1], loc[0], 800).then(setParking)
      api.getChips(loc[1], loc[0], 800).then(setChips)
    })
  }

  const handleDropChip = async (note: string) => {
    await api.dropChip({ lat: location[1], lng: location[0], note }, deviceToken)
    // refresh chips
  }
}
```

